1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,890
(Sheldon:)if we shore up
our weak link,

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,700
(Sheldon:)which is clearly
Leonard as Superman.

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,630
(Leonard:)Hey, I got
new boots this year.

4
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:11,000
(Leonard:)Guaranteed to add
three inches.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,870
(Sheldon:)That's sad.

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:16,970
Let's ask ourselves:

7
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:18,940
(Sheldon:)Is there anyone we know

8
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:23,480
(Sheldon:)who would make a more manly
and convincing son of Krypton?

9
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,780
(Stuart:)Than Leonard
in high-heeled boots?

10
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:29,920
(Stuart:)Howard's mother
in high-heeled boots?

11
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,990
(Sheldon:)I was thinking specifically
of the gentleman over there

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,700
(Sheldon:)moving his lips
as he enjoys

13
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,000
(Sheldon:)the latest exploits
of Betty and Veronica.

14
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,970
(Leonard:)Zack?

15
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:49,610
(Howard:)He is the only person we know
with actual muscles.

16
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:52,710
(Leonard:)You can't replace
me with Zack.

17
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:55,450
(Sheldon:)Why not?
Penny did it.

18
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,380
(Howard:)Yeah, she seems happier.

19
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,780
(Howard:)Why wouldn't we be?

